Generated: a 60-file istanbul-style coverage table, every row carrying four
percentages.

Repro for the second bug found while fixing `git log`. The ANSI filter treated
"contains a percentage" as proof of a redrawn progress line and collapsed
consecutive ones to the last, so this table came out as 3 lines with all 60
files gone and no inline marker. Collapsing now requires consecutive lines to
share a similarity key -- the same line redrawn -- which a table of different
filenames never does.
